   "text": "<<The Streets of Justice>>\n\nYo, the man was caught stealin' a car,  \nOn the streets, he got a ticket, but he was far from tar.  \nHe was arrested, the cops had a plan,  \nBut then he got released on bail, it was a damn scam.  \n\nHe walked out of the jail, with a grin,  \nBut the streets were full of lies and pain.  \nHe was in a bar, the crowd was loud,  \nBut he didn't know what he'd done.  \n\nHe was on the cell, the walls were cold,  \nBut he was still in the fight, he was not lost.  \nThe system was a joke, it was a game,  \nBut he was still a man, and he was a flame.  \n\nSo the streets, the bars, the cell,  \nAll part of the story, and the fight's still real.",
