  "role_pinned": {
   "text": "<<The Cell of the Lost>>\n\n***  \nThe streets are loud, the bars are loud,  \nA cell of chaos, where the night is loud.  \nWe ride the beat, we fight the fight,  \nIn this world of noise, we find our light.  \n\n***  \nThe cell is cold, the bars are bright,  \nA place where dreams are made and lost.  \nWe speak in whispers, we scream in sound,  \nThe streets are our home, the cell is our ground.  \n\n***  \nThe cell is a prison, the bars are a chain,  \nBut we break the rules, we don't let them lean.  \nWe ride the streets, we dance the night,  \nIn this world of noise, we find our fight.  \n\n***  \nSo here's to the streets, the bars, the cell,  \nWhere we rise, we fall, we keep it real.  \nNo chains, no rules, just raw and true,  \nWe're the beat, we're the sound, we're the clue.",
